#: ../../library/kibana.rst:63
msgid ""
"When provisioning Kibana, we want to define the Elasticsearch url in the "
"``kibana.yml``. To allow the user to define which Elasticsearch instance "
"Kibana will connect with, we will define an Input that will be a variable"
" in the ``kibana.yml``, which we will be defining with a File Template."
msgstr "Ao provisionar o Kibana, queremos definir a url do Elasticsearch no ``kibana.yml``. Para permitir que o usuário defina com qual instância Elasticsearch o Kibana se conectará, definiremos uma Entrada que será uma variável no ``kibana.yml``, que definiremos com um File Template."

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:66
msgid "kibana es host"
msgstr "kibana es host"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:68
msgid "Elasticsearch Host for Kibana"
msgstr "Host Elasticsearch para Kibana"

