"Not this field name as it will be used when adding the varibale to the "
"``kibana.yml`` File Template, which will be ``<%= customOptions.esurl "
"%>``."
msgstr "Anote este nome de campo, pois será usado ao adicionar a variável ao File Template ``kibana.yml``, que será ``<%= customOptions.esurl %>``."

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:73 ../../library/kibana.rst:100
msgid "TYPE"
msgstr "TIPO"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:74
msgid "Text, as we will allow the user to define the Elasticsearch host url."
msgstr "Texto, pois permitiremos que o usuário defina a url do host Elasticsearch."

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:75 ../../library/kibana.rst:102
msgid "LABEL"
msgstr "RÓTULO"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:76
msgid ""
"Defined as ``elasticsearch.url:``, which will be the label of the input "
"field for the Elasticsearch URL"
msgstr "Definido como ``elasticsearch.url:``, que será o rótulo do campo de entrada para a URL do Elasticsearch"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:77 ../../library/kibana.rst:104
msgid "PLACEHOLDER"
msgstr "PLACEHOLDER"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:78
msgid ""
"Added ``http://elaticsearch_host:9200`` so users know the proper format "
"for entering the Elasticsearch URL at provision time."
msgstr "Adicionado ``http://elaticsearch_host:9200`` para que os usuários saibam o formato correto para informar a URL do Elasticsearch no momento do provisionamento."

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:79 ../../library/kibana.rst:106
msgid "DEFAULT VALUE"
msgstr "VALOR PADRÃO"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:80
msgid "Left blank as we will not know the Elasticsearch URL required"
msgstr "Deixado em branco, pois não saberemos a URL do Elasticsearch necessária"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:81 ../../library/kibana.rst:108
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Obrigatório"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:82
msgid "Enabled to ensure user defines the Elasticsearch URL"
